# Better Part of Valor (crystalWar 12): a level 99 Warrior in Bastok Markets [S] with The Fighting Fourth completed (a
# GM: xi.wotg.helpers.hasCompletedFirstQuest; missions as group 1's flows) and a Gnole Claw. Engelhart while available:
# no section: his default 104. North Gustaberg [S] from Bastok Markets [S]: the zone-in's 1 (left open), finished on
# option 0: begun, the Clump of Animal Hair. Bastok Markets [S]: Engelhart Prog 0: 116, finished: Prog 1, the hair
# taken; Prog 1: 117. North Gustaberg [S] (the zone-in from Bastok Markets [S] while accepted: nothing): qm1 3,
# finished: Prog 2; Prog 2: nil (no script, no default); Solitary Ant 2 (an Event, replaceDefault). Vunkerl Inlet [S]:
# Leadavox: the claw at Prog 2: nil (the claw stays); 101, finished: Prog 3; 102; the claw alone: 103, finished: the
# trade confirmed, the Xhifhut, Prog 4; Prog 4: nil (his default 100). Bastok Markets [S]: Engelhart 118, finished:
# completed (10000 gil, the Warning Letter), the Xhifhut taken, needToZone. Completed (no section): Engelhart: Fires of
# Discontent's 120 (its arm: the next quest is available); North Gustaberg [S]: Solitary Ant's default 112, qm1 nil;
# Vunkerl Inlet [S]: Leadavox's default 100.
lists BastokMarketsS/Engelhart/onTrigger BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/116 BastokMarketsS/onEventFinish/118 NorthGustabergS/onZoneIn/1 NorthGustabergS/onEventFinish/1 NorthGustabergS/qm1/onTrigger NorthGustabergS/Solitary_Ant/onTrigger NorthGustabergS/onEventFinish/3 VunkerlInletS/Leadavox/onTrigger VunkerlInletS/Leadavox/onTrade VunkerlInletS/onEventFinish/101 VunkerlInletS/onEventFinish/103
char zone=BastokMarketsS pos=-78.585,-4.425,-125.327 job=WAR lvl=99
item GnoleClaw
quest CrystalWar.TheFightingFourth completed
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Engelhart                       # available: no section: his default 104; the mission takes no talk
finish-if-event
warp 380.038,-2.25,147.627 NorthGustabergS open # from Bastok Markets [S]: 1, left open
finish                                  # begun; the Clump of Animal Hair
warp -78.585,-4.425,-125.327 BastokMarketsS
trigger Engelhart                       # Prog 0: 116
finish                                  # Prog 1; the hair taken
trigger Engelhart                       # Prog 1: 117
finish
warp -575.082,39.854,64.186 NorthGustabergS # from Bastok Markets [S] while accepted: no zone-in reply
trigger qm1                             # Prog 1: 3
finish                                  # Prog 2
trigger qm1                             # Prog 2: nil (no default)
finish-if-event
warp 376.532,0.865,151.645 NorthGustabergS
trigger Solitary_Ant                    # 2 (replaceDefault)
finish
warp 208.581,-32.002,315.458 VunkerlInletS
trade Leadavox GnoleClaw x1             # Prog 2: nil (the claw stays)
finish-if-event
trigger Leadavox                        # Prog 2: 101
finish                                  # Prog 3
trigger Leadavox                        # Prog 3: 102
finish
trade Leadavox GnoleClaw x1             # Prog 3, the claw alone: 103
finish                                  # the trade confirmed; the Xhifhut; Prog 4
trigger Leadavox                        # Prog 4: nil: his default 100
finish-if-event
warp -78.585,-4.425,-125.327 BastokMarketsS
trigger Engelhart                       # Prog 4: 118
finish                                  # completed (10000 gil, the Warning Letter); the Xhifhut taken; needToZone
trigger Engelhart                       # completed: no section: Fires of Discontent's 120 (BPoV completed)
finish option=1                         # Fires begun (its arm)
warp 376.532,0.865,151.645 NorthGustabergS # from Bastok Markets [S] while completed: no zone-in reply
trigger Solitary_Ant                    # completed: no section: his default 112
finish-if-event
warp -575.082,39.854,64.186 NorthGustabergS
trigger qm1                             # completed: nil
finish-if-event
warp 208.581,-32.002,315.458 VunkerlInletS
trigger Leadavox                        # completed: his default 100
finish-if-event
